{"items":[{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#launch-ghgmz7gca9dlcdpg7nvwrv","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"launch-ghgmz7gca9dlcdpg7nvwrv","dateCreated":"2025-08-26T14:14:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-08-26T14:14:30+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of seven highly expressive Amazon Polly Generative voices in English, French, Polish and Dutch.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a fully-managed service that turns text into lifelike speech, enabling developers and builders to speechify their applications for conversational AI or for speech content creation.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nWe are excited to share that Amazon Polly today launches one new male-sounding generative voice: Canadian French - Liam\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003etogether with six new female-sounding generative voices: US English - Salli, Belgian French - Isabelle, French - Celine, Canadian French - Gabrielle, Polish - Ola, and Polish - Ewa. This launch expands the number of voices available on Polly\u0027s Generative TTS engine to twenty-seven diverse voices.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nWith this release, Polly now offers six male-sounding voices (Canadian French - Liam, French - Rémi, German - Daniel, US Spanish - Pedro, Spain Spanish - Sergio, and Mexico Spanish - Andrés) that speak multiple languages while maintaining the same vocal identity as the US English voice Matthew. Having the same voice identity while speaking multiple languages natively enables customers to switch from one language to another while preserving brand identity across regions/locales. This is made possible by Amazon Polly’s GenAI-based polyglot capability, where a single voice is able to synthesize speech in multiple languages.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nAll generative voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia), Europe (Frankfurt), and US West (Oregon) regions and complement the other types of voices that are already available in the same regions.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nTo hear how Polly voices sound, go to\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d3\"\u003eAmazon Polly Features\u003c/a\u003e. For more details on the Polly offerings and use, please read the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and visit our\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d4\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/08/amazon-polly-new-synthetic-generative-voices","postDateTime":"2025-08-26T07:00:00Z","headline":"Amazon Polly launches more synthetic generative voices"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2025","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2025","description":"\u003cp\u003e2025\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1691432147","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"sNJh4ha9gUnGHMQN9ha23w","dateCreated":"2025-03-20T17:43:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-26T17:37:25+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Jihye - new Korean Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) female voice for Amazon Polly.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a fully-managed service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nJihye is our new Korean voice that has a unique personality and style. We have trained it as a primarily conversational voice using carefully designed text and fully conversational speech recordings. Jihye can be adopted for a variety of speech products depending on the customer needs. It will perform at the highest quality in the interactive voice response (IVR) use cases, and will be most suitable for customer service, marketing, or education purposes.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nJihye and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/03/new-korean-voice-amazon-polly","postDateTime":"2025-03-26T13:30:00-04:00","headline":"New Korean voice for Amazon Polly"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2025","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2025","description":"\u003cp\u003e2025\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1650157886","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"aa5JnghqVDGVe8JDdLzxgr","dateCreated":"2025-01-29T16:28:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-02-11T22:48:15+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Jasmine - new Singaporean English Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) female voice for Amazon Polly.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nJasmine is our first voice for the Singaporean variant of English. Even though Singaporean English is reported to be close to British English, there are some unique pronunciation patterns that we captured while training this voice, such as pronunciation of telephone numbers or postal codes, to make sure that Jasmine sounds like a local speaker. With this launch, we continue building a variety of voice and language options for Amazon Polly customers.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nJasmine and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/02/amazon-polly-new-voice-singaporean-english","postDateTime":"2025-02-11T17:43:00-05:00","headline":"Amazon Polly launches a new voice in Singaporean English"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2025","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2025","description":"\u003cp\u003e2025\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-12-30T16:07:22+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1293375926","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"launch-sLAoY4hgWJCBD15LELz3ug","dateCreated":"2024-11-11T18:35:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-15T17:31:58+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Polly Long-Form engine now introduces two voices in Spanish and one in US English.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing our customers to build speech-enabled products matching their business needs. Today, we add three new long-form voices to our premium Polly Text-to-Speech (TTS) line of products that we offer for synthesizing speech for longer content, such as articles, stories, or training materials.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nMale-sounding US English voice Patrick, female-sounding Spanish voice Alba, and male-sounding Spanish voice Ra\u0026uacute;l can now read long texts, such as blogs, articles, or learning materials. We trained them using the cutting edge technology that uses semantic cues to modify voice\u0026rsquo;s speaking style depending on the context. The result is natural-sounding, expressive voices that not only provide our customers with the ability of synthesizing their content in human-like Spanish and English, but expand their use-cases to long content reading.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nPatrick, Alba, and Ra\u0026uacute;l long-form voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia) region and complement the other long-form voices that are already available for developing speech products for a variety of use cases.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nTo hear how Polly voices sound, go to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly Features\u003c/a\u003e. For more details on the Polly offerings and use, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d4\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/three-long-form-voices/","postDateTime":"2024-11-14T10:00:00-08:00","headline":"Three new Long-Form Voices"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-17T18:03:36+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1548264136","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"kWwrNaNVRaJfK95nT86VZh","dateCreated":"2024-11-01T15:08:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-06T21:29:52+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of six highly expressive Amazon Polly generative voices in English, French, Spanish, and German.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a managed service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build speech-enabled products depending on your business needs.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nThe generative engine is Amazon Polly\u0026#39;s most advanced text-to-speech (TTS) model. Today, we release six new synthetic female-sounding generative voices: i.e., Ayanda (South African English), L\u0026eacute;a (French), Lucia (European Spanish), Lupe (American Spanish), M\u0026iacute;a (Mexican Spanish), and Vicki (German). This launch increases the number of generative Polly voices from seven to thirteen and expands our footprint from three to nine locales. Leveraging the same Gen-AI technology that powered the English generative voices, Polly now supports German, Spanish, and French to provide our customers with more options of highly expressive and engaging voices.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nAyanda, L\u0026eacute;a, Lucia, Lupe, M\u0026iacute;a, and Vicki generative voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia), Europe (Frankfurt), and US West (Oregon) regions and complement the other types of voices that are already available in the same regions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eTo hear how Polly voices sound, go to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly Features\u003c/a\u003e. For more details on the Polly offerings and use, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d4\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/six-new-synthetic-generative-voices-amazon-polly","postDateTime":"2024-11-06T13:00:00-04:00","headline":"Six new synthetic generative voices for Amazon Polly "}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-17T18:03:36+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1412649245","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"launch-a89BqcfbiMFUtaM1MWhDtT","dateCreated":"2024-09-30T19:03:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-10-10T17:19:49+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of four highly expressive Amazon Polly voices speaking in American and Australian English.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a managed service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build speech-enabled products depending on your business needs.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nThe generative engine is Amazon Polly\u0026#39;s most advanced text-to-speech (TTS) model. With this launch, we add a variety of new synthetic generative English voices to Polly portfolio: i.e., an Australian English voice Olivia, and three US English voices Joanna, Danielle, and Stephen. These voices sound similar to our neural voices with the same names, but they have much more natural pronunciation and prosody. Our customers can use this high-tier product in various industries and for different purposes: e.g., education, publishing, marketing, etc.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nDanielle, Joanna, Olivia, and Stephen generative voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia), Europe (Frankfurt), and US West (Oregon) regions and complement the other types of voices that are already available in the same regions.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nFor more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d4\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/10/four-new-synthetic-generative-voices-amazon-polly/","postDateTime":"2024-10-10T10:00:00-07:00","headline":"Four new synthetic generative voices for Amazon Polly "}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-17T18:03:36+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#v1472684773","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"knJwys2tWJGYoHL1GcY7YA","dateCreated":"2024-08-19T16:00:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-27T21:42:12+0000","additionalFields":{"nofollow":"0","noindex":"0","postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of two female-sounding Amazon Polly voices for two new locales: Czechia and Switzerland.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a managed service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build speech-enabled products depending on your business needs.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nWe have developed a Swiss Standard German voice Sabrina and a Czech voice Jitka using a well-established neural TTS technology allowing our customers to synthesize natural human-like speech. With these voices, we bring Polly to two new countries and expand our language offerings. Sabrina and Jitka are conversational voices that can be used in Interactive Voice Response technology and more.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nSabrina and Jitka voices are accessible in all Polly regions and complement the other types of voices that are already available for developing speech products for a variety of use cases.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\nFor more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/?nc\u003dsn\u0026amp;loc\u003d4\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/08/polly-voices-new-locales","postDateTime":"2024-08-27T17:40:00-04:00","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Polly Voices for two new locales: Czechia and Switzerland"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2024-05-generative-engine-three-english-polly-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/05/generative-engine-three-english-polly-voices/","dateCreated":"2024-05-08T18:16:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T15:02:57+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of the highly expressive generative engine with the three English Amazon Polly voices: two American English voices, Ruth and Matthew, and one British English voice Amy. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build speech-enabled products depending on your business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe generative engine is Amazon Polly\u0027s most advanced text-to-speech (TTS) model. It has been trained with a variety of voices, languages, and styles. It performs with the high precision to render context-dependent prosody, pausing, spelling, dialectal properties, foreign word pronunciation, and more. Generative synthetic voices are emotionally engaged, assertive, and highly colloquial in a way that makes them remarkably similar to human voice. We ensured that despite the powerful abilities of the new voices, they are also suitable for low latency online conversational use-cases. Our customers can use a generative voice persona as a knowledgeable customer assistant, a virtual trainer, or an advertiser with a near-human synthetic speech.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eRuth, Matthew, and Amy generative voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia) region and complement the other English voices that are already available for developing speech products for a variety of use cases. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2024-05-08T18:15:51Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/05/generative-engine-three-english-polly-voices/","postDateTime":"2024-05-08T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"New Generative Engine with three synthetic English Polly voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of the highly expressive generative engine with the three English Amazon Polly voices: two American English voices, Ruth and Matthew, and one British English voice Amy. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2024-02-amazon-polly-neural-turkish-voice-burcu","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/02/amazon-polly-neural-turkish-voice-burcu/","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T20:29:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:59:26+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Burcu - new Turkish Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) female voice for Amazon Polly.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eBurcu is our first NTTS voice for Turkish customers. We developed this female-sounding voice using neural technology that makes it sound natural and human-like. Burcu is added to another Turkish voice Feliz that is already available for developing voice products. With this launch, we continue building a variety of voice and language options for Amazon Polly customers.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eBurcu and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2024-02-14T20:29:17Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/02/amazon-polly-neural-turkish-voice-burcu/","postDateTime":"2024-02-14T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"New Amazon Polly Neural Turkish Voice: Burcu","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Burcu - new Turkish Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) female voice for Amazon Polly.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-11-aws-long-form-three-expressive-english-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/11/aws-long-form-three-expressive-english-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-16T19:46:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:49:50+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of the highly expressive long-form engine with the first three American English Amazon Polly voices available to our customers in the US.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a\u0026nbsp;service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build speech-enabled products depending on your business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe new long-form engine is the premium product tier of Polly Text-to-Speech (TTS), represented by three American English voices: i.e., Danielle, Gregory, and Ruth. To offer this novel type of synthesized natural-sounding speech, we have reinvented neural Polly voices with cutting-edge deep learning TTS technology. The result is human-like, highly expressive, and emotionally adept voices that will be helpful to our customers from media, marketing, and education industries, among many others. We designed the long-form voices with the intent of captivating listeners’ attention to longer content, such as news articles, training materials, or marketing videos. The updated technology opens new opportunities for using this line of the speech product in various use-cases, and we are delighted to release it for our customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eDanielle, Gregory, and Ruth long-form voices are accessible in the US East (North Virginia) region and complement the other 13 en-US voices that are already available for developing speech products for a variety of use cases. For more details, please read\u0026nbsp;the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-11-16T19:46:32Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/11/aws-long-form-three-expressive-english-voices/","postDateTime":"2023-11-16T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"AWS now offers long-form engine with the first three expressive American English voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of the highly expressive long-form engine with the first three American English Amazon Polly voices available to our customers in the US.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-08-amazon-polly-gulf-arabic-male-ntts-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/08/amazon-polly-gulf-arabic-male-ntts-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T15:09:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T15:03:09+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Zayd - new Gulf Arabic Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eZayd is our first male voice for the Gulf region that we added to the existing female neural voice Hala. To create this voice, we used technology that disentangles speech properties of a large recording database collected from speakers of both genders and different Arabic dialects. The outcome is a unique synthesized voice with speech properties of a male speaking both in Gulf Arabic and Modern Standard Arabic. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eZayd and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-08-16T16:58:32Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/08/amazon-polly-gulf-arabic-male-ntts-voice/","postDateTime":"2023-08-16T12:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches new Gulf Arabic male NTTS voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Zayd - new Gulf Arabic Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-08-amazon-polly-belgian-french-female-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/08/amazon-polly-belgian-french-female-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T15:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:35:15+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Isabelle - new Belgian French Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eIsabelle is our first synthetic voice for French-speaking users in Belgium. We developed Isabelle using an advanced neural technology that makes it sound natural and human-like. Since Isabelle will be used in a multilingual environment, we also made sure that she can pronounce Flemish and English words correctly.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eIsabelle and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-08-01T18:46:51Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/08/amazon-polly-belgian-french-female-voice/","postDateTime":"2023-08-01T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches new Belgian French female voice Isabelle","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Isabelle - new Belgian French Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-06-amazon-polly-female-ntts-voice-belgian-dutch-flemish","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/06/amazon-polly-female-ntts-voice-belgian-dutch-flemish/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T15:05:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:55:19+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Lisa - a new Belgian Dutch female Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eLisa is our first synthetic voice in Belgian Dutch, a language variant also known as Flemish. Lisa will be available alongside another neural Dutch voice - Laura - that was developed for the Netherlands. This release is intended for our customers who offer voice products to their Belgian Dutch speaking users.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eLisa and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-06-07T18:56:19Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/06/amazon-polly-female-ntts-voice-belgian-dutch-flemish/","postDateTime":"2023-06-07T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches a new female NTTS voice in Belgian Dutch (Flemish) ","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Lisa - a new Belgian Dutch female Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voice for Amazon Polly. \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-05-amazon-polly-new-female-ntts-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/05/amazon-polly-new-female-ntts-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T15:05:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:47:59+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Niamh and Sofie - new Irish English and Danish female Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices for Amazon Polly. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eNiamh is our first synthetic voice for customers serving users in The Republic of Ireland. We developed Niamh using an advanced technology that “teaches” existing voices to speak with different accents. Niamh is designed to sound like someone native to Ireland and has the same voice personality as Amy, the UK English voice. Customers can use these two voices interchangeably to serve Irish English and British English audience without changing their voice experience.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eSofie is our first neural Danish voice that we added to the existing Danish standard voices: i.e., Naja (female) and Mads (male). With this launch, we offer our customers an opportunity to build new voice products for Danish speakers. Sofie’s personality and enhanced voice features (such as proper English pronunciation) is designed for listeners in Scandinavia.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eNiamh, Sofie and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-05-30T17:00:26Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/05/amazon-polly-new-female-ntts-voices/","postDateTime":"2023-05-30T12:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches two new female NTTS voices in Irish English and Danish","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce the general availability of Niamh and Sofie - new Irish English and Danish female Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices for Amazon Polly. \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-04-amazon-polly-support-osaka-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/04/amazon-polly-support-osaka-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:48:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:46:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of the entire portfolio of Amazon Polly\u0027s Neural and Standard voices in the Asia Pacific (Osaka) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize natural sounding human speech. NTTS voices can be applied to a diverse set of use cases to increase customer engagement. For example, giving interactive voice response (IVR) or virtual assistant agents’ natural sounding voices or producing spoken versions of text-based content. For eLearning, audiobooks, newsreaders, and other content, you can also provide audio/visual experiences by synchronizing speech with facial animation or karaoke-style word highlighting.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers in the following 15 regions can now experience higher voice quality and lower latency when using Amazon Polly: US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), Africa (Cape Town), Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Asia Pacific (Osaka), Canada (Central), Europe (Frankfurt), Europe (Ireland), Europe (London), Europe (Paris) and AWS GovCloud (US-West).\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo learn more about Amazon Polly, visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eproduct page\u003c/a\u003e or \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-04-05T17:31:46Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/04/amazon-polly-support-osaka-region/","postDateTime":"2023-04-05T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly offers full support in the AWS Asia Pacific (Osaka) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of the entire portfolio of Amazon Polly\u0027s Neural and Standard voices in the Asia Pacific (Osaka) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-02-amazon-polly-two-japanese-ntts-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/02/amazon-polly-two-japanese-ntts-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:57:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:51:53+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Kazuha and Tomoko, two new female Japanese neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers two more voices supporting Japanese. They are our first neural female voices with different personalities that expand our portfolio for this locale to three female voices and one male voice. We launch two voices at the same time to give our customers a wider range of female voice options to choose from.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eKazuha and Tomoko and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-02-08T18:02:41Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/02/amazon-polly-two-japanese-ntts-voices/","postDateTime":"2023-02-08T13:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches two new Japanese NTTS voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Kazuha and Tomoko, two new female Japanese neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-01-amazon-polly-two-new-us-english-ntts-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/01/amazon-polly-two-new-us-english-ntts-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:54:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:51:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Ruth and Stephen, two new US English neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers two more voices supporting US English: Ruth is a new neural female voice and Stephen is a new neural male voice. They expand our portfolio for this locale to 6 female voices and 4 male voices. We created Ruth and Stephen as different voice personas, compared to other available US voices, to give our customers a wider range of female and male voice options to choose from.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eRuth, Stephen and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-01-31T19:44:05Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/01/amazon-polly-two-new-us-english-ntts-voices/","postDateTime":"2023-01-31T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches two new US English NTTS voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Ruth and Stephen, two new US English neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2023-01-amazon-polly-male-ntts-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/01/amazon-polly-male-ntts-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T15:00:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:38:46+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of five new male neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices: Sergio for Castilian Spanish, Andrés for Mexican Spanish, Rémi for French, Adriano for Italian, and Thiago for Brazilian Portuguese. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThis update leverages cutting-edge technology to use characteristics of existing NTTS voices to build new voice options in different languages. We applied some of the vocal characteristics of the US English Matthew voice to five new language variants creating an extra opportunity for customers to serve content in different languages using one and the same voice persona.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers both male and female voices for each locale: Spain, Mexico, France, Italy, and Brazil. Andrés is our first male Mexican Spanish voice, while Sergio, Rémi, Adriano, and Thiago are new neural conversational male voices that are available alongside existing standard voices - Enrique, Mathieu, Giorgio, and Ricardo.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThese and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2023-01-24T21:58:57Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2023/01/amazon-polly-male-ntts-voices/","postDateTime":"2023-01-24T13:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches five new male NTTS voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of five new male neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices: Sergio for Castilian Spanish, Andrés for Mexican Spanish, Rémi for French, Adriano for Italian, and Thiago for Brazilian Portuguese. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2023","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2023","description":"year#2023","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:00:12+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-11-amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-polish-arabic","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-polish-arabic/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:58:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:29:50+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of two voices: Ola, a new female Polish neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voice and Hala, a new female NTTS voice in Arabic (Gulf).\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eOla is Amazon Polly’s first Polish neural TTS voice. We have designed it to sound friendly, welcoming and professional, which makes it applicable to a wide range of TTS use cases such as Interactive Voice Response systems, articles and educational content. Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/04/amazon-polly-adds-arabic-language-support/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eadded support for Arabic in 2019 by launching Zeina\u003c/a\u003e, a\u0026nbsp;standard TTS voice following the Modern Standard Arabic (MSA) pronunciation. The voice we launched today, Hala, is a dialectical Gulf Arabic (ar-AE) voice that also supports MSA when invoked with the \u0026quot;arb\u0026quot; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supportedtags.html#lang-tag\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003e\u0026lt;lang\u0026gt; tag\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eBoth Ola and Hala are availble in all \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-11-17T22:07:35Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-polish-arabic/","postDateTime":"2022-11-17T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches neural TTS support for Polish and Arabic","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of two voices: Ola, a new female Polish neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voice and Hala, a new female NTTS voice in Arabic (Gulf).\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-11-amazon-polly-vpc-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-vpc-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:41:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:46:25+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Starting today, you can now use Amazon Polly inside an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/what-is-amazon-vpc.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)\u003c/a\u003e, instead of connecting over the internet, which allows you to have better control over your network environment.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eStarting from today, Amazon Polly customers can use AWS PrivateLink to access privately the Polly APIs from your virtual private cloud. This is available in all AWS Regions where Amazon Polly is supported. AWS PrivateLink provides private connectivity between VPCs, AWS services, and your networks. You can now manage your AWS resources in your VPC using AWS PrivateLink and meet your organization’s security and compliance requirements. To use AWS PrivateLink, create an interface VPC endpoint for Amazon Polly in your VPC using the Amazon VPC console, SDK, or CLI. You can also access the VPC endpoint from on-premises environments or from other VPCs using AWS VPN, AWS Direct Connect, or VPC Peering. From today going forward you no longer need to use an internet gateway, Network Address Translation (NAT) devices, or firewall proxies to connect to Amazon Polly.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e. To get started, visit the AWS Console and review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-11-09T21:09:06Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-vpc-support/","postDateTime":"2022-11-09T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) support is generally available for Amazon Polly","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Starting today, you can now use Amazon Polly inside an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/what-is-amazon-vpc.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)\u003c/a\u003e, instead of connecting over the internet, which allows you to have better control over your network environment.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-vpc","description":"general:products/amazon-vpc","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:51:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:51:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-11-amazon-polly-neural-support-swedish-norwegian-finnish","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-neural-support-swedish-norwegian-finnish/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:53:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:49:25+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, a service that turns text into lifelike speech, announced the general availability of three new neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices: Elin for Swedish, Ida for Norwegian and Suvi for Finnish.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eWe have designed all three voices to sound friendly and welcoming to make them suitable for general content in publication, interactive voice response services and for educational use cases. With this launch Amazon Polly offers now Neural TTS support for 26 languages and language variants.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eElin, Ida and Suvi are availble in all \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-11-08T18:01:06Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-neural-support-swedish-norwegian-finnish/","postDateTime":"2022-11-08T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":" Amazon Polly adds neural support for Swedish, Norwegian and Finnish","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, a service that turns text into lifelike speech, announced the general availability of three new neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voices: Elin for Swedish, Ida for Norwegian and Suvi for Finnish.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-11-amazon-polly-launches-dutch-ntts-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-launches-dutch-ntts-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:52:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:48:56+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a\u0026nbsp;service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Laura, a new female Dutch neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers three voices supporting Dutch: Ruben, Lotte and the newly released Laura. Ruben and Lotte are standard voices whereas Laura is the first neural voice. In the Netherlands, English is spoken by the vast majority of the population. Amazon Polly’s, Laura, speaks both Dutch and English with equal ease and nativity. \u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eLaura and all the other NTTS voices are available in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS regions supporting Neural TTS\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-11-02T19:07:53Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/11/amazon-polly-launches-dutch-ntts-voice/","postDateTime":"2022-11-02T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":" Amazon Polly launches a Dutch NTTS voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a\u0026nbsp;service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Laura, a new female Dutch neural Text-to-speech (NTTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-09-amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-paris-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-paris-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:53:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:18:27+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Europe (Paris) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize natural sounding human speech. NTTS voices can be applied to a diverse set of use cases to increase customer engagement. For example, giving interactive voice response (IVR) or virtual assistant agents’ natural sounding voices or producing spoken versions of text-based content. For eLearning, audiobooks, newsreaders, and other content, you can also provide audio/visual experiences by synchronizing speech with facial animation or karaoke-style word highlighting.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers in the following 14 regions can now experience higher voice quality and lower latency when using Amazon Polly: US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), Africa (Cape Town), Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Central), Europe (Frankfurt), Europe (Ireland), Europe (London), Europe (Paris) and AWS GovCloud (US-West).\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-09-22T17:10:26Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-paris-region/","postDateTime":"2022-09-22T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly NTTS voices now available in the AWS Europe (Paris) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Europe (Paris) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-09-amazon-polly-cantonese-language-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-cantonese-language-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:54:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:23:55+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Hiujin, Amazon Polly’s first Cantonese speaking, neural text to speech (NTTS) voice\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eHiujin is available as a neural voice in all of the 13 AWS regions supporting NTTS. It offers human-like pausing and intonation. In addition, Hiujin provides full support for traditional Chinese characters and limited support for simplified characters. As English is one of the official languages in Hong Kong and mixing English words with Cantonese is very common, we have optimized the performance on common English-Cantonese mixed sentence to make Hiujin sound more natural. With this launch, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 96 voices across 34 languages and language variants.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Hiujin, read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-09-20T16:26:23Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-cantonese-language-support/","postDateTime":"2022-09-20T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly adds Cantonese language support","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Hiujin, Amazon Polly’s first Cantonese speaking, neural text to speech (NTTS) voice\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-09-amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-asia-pacific-mumbai","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-asia-pacific-mumbai/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:54:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:23:00+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Asia Pacific (Mumbai) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Polly\u0027s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/what-is-text-to-speech/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eText-to-Speech\u003c/a\u003e (TTS) service uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize natural sounding human speech. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly voices can be applied to a diverse set of use cases to increase customer engagement. For example, giving interactive voice response (IVR) or virtual assistant agents’ natural sounding voices or producing spoken versions of text-based content. For eLearning, audiobooks, newsreaders, and other content, you can also provide audio/visual experiences by synchronizing speech with facial animation or karaoke-style word highlighting.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers in the following 13 regions can now experience higher voice quality and lower latency when using Amazon Polly: US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), Africa (Cape Town), Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul),\u0026nbsp;Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney),\u0026nbsp;Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Central),\u0026nbsp;Europe (Frankfurt), Europe (Ireland), Europe (London) and AWS GovCloud (US-West). Refer to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eGlobal Infrastructure page\u003c/a\u003e for the latest list.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e and log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out. We encourage you also to review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-09-01T17:10:04Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-asia-pacific-mumbai/","postDateTime":"2022-09-01T12:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly NTTS voices now available in Asia Pacific (Mumbai)","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Asia Pacific (Mumbai) Region.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-08-amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-mandarin-chinese","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/08/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-mandarin-chinese/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:38:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:17:18+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Zhiyu, Polly’s Mandarin Chinese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly launched the Mandarin Chinese voice Zhiyu using standard technology in 2018, and as of today a neural version of Zhiyu is also available. The new voice offers a more natural intonation and better performance on English in code-mixing scenario. With this launch, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 95 voices across 33 languages and language variants, out of which 21 are supported by the neural engine.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Zhiyu, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and read the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly  \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-08-23T16:28:06Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/08/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-mandarin-chinese/","postDateTime":"2022-08-23T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly now offers Neural TTS support for Mandarin Chinese","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Zhiyu, Polly’s Mandarin Chinese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-07-amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-hindi-indian-english","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/07/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-hindi-indian-english/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:37:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:58:57+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Kajal, a new bilingual neural text to speech (TTS) voice supporting Hindi and Indian English.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly offers a bilingual TTS voice supporting Hindi and Indian English. It’s a standard TTS voice called Aditi. With the just released voice Kajal you can, similarly to Aditi, synthesize speech in both English and Hindi, and the voice can switch between the two languages even within the same sentence. With releasing Kajal we are not only extending the voice selection for Hindi and Indian English but also enabling neural voice experiences for two additional languages. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Kajal, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and read about \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/bilingual-voices.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003ebilingual voices in our documentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQ page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-07-27T15:48:23Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/07/amazon-polly-neural-tts-support-hindi-indian-english/","postDateTime":"2022-07-27T04:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly now offers Neural TTS support for Hindi and Indian English","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Kajal, a new bilingual neural text to speech (TTS) voice supporting Hindi and Indian English.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-06-amazon-polly-adds-male-neural-tts-voices-languages","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/06/amazon-polly-adds-male-neural-tts-voices-languages/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:41:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:19:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e  is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of 4 male Neural TTS voices: Liam for Canadian French, Arthur for UK English, Daniel for German and Pedro for US Spanish.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\nAll four voices have been modeled on Matthew, an existing US English voice. While customers continue to appreciate Matthew for his naturalness and professional-sounding quality, he has so far exclusively served English-speaking traffic.  Now we were able to decouple language and speaker profile, which allowed us to preserve native-like fluency across different languages without the necessity of obtaining multilingual data from the same speaker. As a result, we transferred the highly likeable vocal characteristics of Matthew to four new languages.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Liam, Arthur, Daniel and Pedro, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e ,\u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-06-28T18:30:07Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/06/amazon-polly-adds-male-neural-tts-voices-languages/","postDateTime":"2022-06-28T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly adds new male Neural TTS voices in 4 languages","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e  is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of 4 male Neural TTS voices: Liam for Canadian French, Arthur for UK English, Daniel for German and Pedro for US Spanish.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-04-amazon-polly-offers-new-neural-tts-voice-brazilian-portuguese","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-offers-new-neural-tts-voice-brazilian-portuguese/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:39:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:20:26+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Vitória, Polly’s Brazilian Portuguese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly launched the Brazilian Portuguese voice Vitória using standard technology in 2016, and as of today a neural version of Vitória is also available. The new voice offers a more natural sounding rhythm, intonation, and sound articulation. In addition to Vitória, Polly also offers a second Brazilian Portuguese neural voice, Camila.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Vitória, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing,\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-04-28T21:16:54Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-offers-new-neural-tts-voice-brazilian-portuguese/","postDateTime":"2022-04-28T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly now offers a new Neural TTS voice in Brazilian Portuguese","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Vitória, Polly’s Brazilian Portuguese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-04-amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voice-portuguese","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voice-portuguese/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:36:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:08:51+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a Neural version of Inês, Polly’s European Portuguese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eInês, the European Portuguese TTS voice, has been available as a Standard voice. Neural Inês offers a more natural sounding voice with better rhythm, pausing, and sound articulation. With this launch, Amazon Polly now supports Standard and Neural voices in Brazilian and European Portuguese.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Inês, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-04-26T18:57:53Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voice-portuguese/","postDateTime":"2022-04-26T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly now offers a Neural TTS voice in Portuguese","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a Neural version of Inês, Polly’s European Portuguese female text to speech (TTS) voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-04-amazon-polly-launches-austrian-german-neural-text-speech-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-launches-austrian-german-neural-text-speech-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:48:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:10:41+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Hannah, a new Austrian German Neural voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update, and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Hannah, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-04-19T21:39:21Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/04/amazon-polly-launches-austrian-german-neural-text-speech-voice/","postDateTime":"2022-04-19T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Launches a new Austrian German Neural Text-to-Speech voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Hannah, a new Austrian German Neural voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-03-amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voices-catalan-mexican-spanish","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/03/amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voices-catalan-mexican-spanish/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:51:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:56:15+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of two voices: a Neural version of Mia, Polly’s Mexican Spanish female text to speech (TTS) voice and Arlet, a new Catalan Neural voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTTS voices simplify the way you can create, implement, update and maintain your speech-enabled applications and products. You can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly launched the Mexican Spanish TTS voice Mia using Standard technology in 2018, and as of today a Neural version of Mia is also available. With this launch, Amazon Polly now supports Standard and Neural voices in three different versions of Spanish: US, Castilian and Mexican. Catalan is a new language in Amazon Polly\u0027s portfolio and is available as a Neural voice. Arlet enables customers to create delightful TTS experiences for Catalan speakers around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Mia and Arlet, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e , \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html#ntts-regions\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e, and visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-03-29T17:41:00Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/03/amazon-polly-offers-neural-tts-voices-catalan-mexican-spanish/","postDateTime":"2022-03-23T16:14:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly now offers Neural TTS voices in Catalan and Mexican Spanish","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of two voices: a Neural version of Mia, Polly’s Mexican Spanish female text to speech (TTS) voice and Arlet, a new Catalan Neural voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2022-03-amazon-chime-sdk-supports-amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/03/amazon-chime-sdk-supports-amazon-polly/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:50:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:20:01+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Chime SDK lets developers add real-time audio, video, screen-sharing, and messaging capabilities to their web or mobile applications. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech.  Starting today, the Amazon Chime SDK supports native integration with Amazon Polly, making it easy for builders to create applications that turn text and numerical data into lifelike speech and automatically plays the output to a caller.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThis integration streamlines the development of voice self-service prompts since it eliminates the costly and time-consuming dependency on the professional voice recording.  For example, you could build a voice order status application that prompts a caller to enter their order number, retrieves the order information from an external database, and then speaks the order ship date back to the caller. You can use Amazon Polly for calls to or from the public telephone network and for calls with on-premises telephone equipment using the Session Initiation Protocol (SIP).\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThis integration supports all available languages and voices in Amazon Polly. You can also choose either plain text or \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/ssml.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eSpeech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML)\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to enrich the generated speech by adding pauses, emphasizing certain words, or to change the speaking style. In addition, to help fine-tune the caller experience, developers can choose between the standard or \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eneural text-to-speech (NTTS)\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;engine for improved speech quality.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly for Amazon Chime SDK is available in the US-East (N. Virginia) and US-West (Oregon) AWS regions. There are no additional Amazon Chime SDK charges to use Amazon Polly. Regular \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly pricing\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;applies.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with the Amazon Chime SDK integration with Amazon Polly, please refer to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/chime/latest/dg/speak.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Chime SDK documentation\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly Developer Guide\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2022-05-11T21:08:34Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2022/03/amazon-chime-sdk-supports-amazon-polly/","postDateTime":"2022-03-17T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"The Amazon Chime SDK now supports Amazon Polly","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Chime SDK lets developers add real-time audio, video, screen-sharing, and messaging capabilities to their web or mobile applications. \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech.  Starting today, the Amazon Chime SDK supports native integration with Amazon Polly, making it easy for builders to create applications that turn text and numerical data into lifelike speech and automatically plays the output to a caller.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-use-case#business-applications-other","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-use-case","name":"business-applications-other","description":"general:use-case/business-applications-other","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-chime","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-chime","description":"general:products/amazon-chime","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:51:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:51:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2022","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2022","description":"year#2022","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-chime-sdk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-chime-sdk","description":"general:products/amazon-chime-sdk","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:33:51+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-12-amazon-polly-takumi-neural-japanese-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/12/amazon-polly-takumi-neural-japanese-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:46:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:38:21+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Takumi, Polly’s Japanese male text to speech (TTS) voice. Takumi neural TTS sounds natural, friendly and smooth. With this launch, you can now select from three unique Japanese TTS voices: Mizuki Standard, Takumi Standard and Takumi Neural.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include interactive voice response (IVR) systems, audiobooks, newsreaders, eLearning content, and virtual assistants. Amazon Polly neural voices are now available in 14 languages. Standard voices are supported in 31 languages.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Takumi, please log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly text-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-12-06T16:54:44Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/12/amazon-polly-takumi-neural-japanese-voice/","postDateTime":"2021-12-06T08:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly introduces Takumi, a new neural Japanese male voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of a neural version of Takumi, Polly’s Japanese male text to speech (TTS) voice. Takumi neural TTS sounds natural, friendly and smooth. With this launch, you can now select from three unique Japanese TTS voices: Mizuki Standard, Takumi Standard and Takumi Neural.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-09-amazon-polly-aws-africa-cape-town-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/09/amazon-polly-aws-africa-cape-town-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:48:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:20:37+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly, a service that turns \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext into speech\u003c/a\u003e, extends its offering to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2020/04/announcing-aws-africa-cape-town-region/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Africa (Cape Town) Region\u003c/a\u003e. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Ayanda, Polly’s first South African English Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS)\u0026nbsp;voice, as well as full support for the entire portfolio of Amazon Polly\u0027s Neural and Standard voices in the AWS Africa (Cape Town) Region. With this launch, the service now supports 31 languages including 7 different varieties of English. Neural TTS voices are available in 12 AWS Regions.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo learn more, see our complete list of Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e and try them out on our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly Console\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/NTTS-main.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-09-01T19:28:53Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/09/amazon-polly-aws-africa-cape-town-region/","postDateTime":"2021-09-01T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly offers full support in the AWS Africa (Cape Town) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly, a service that turns \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext into speech\u003c/a\u003e, extends its offering to the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2020/04/announcing-aws-africa-cape-town-region.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Africa (Cape Town) Region\u003c/a\u003e. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Ayanda, Polly’s first South African English Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS)\u0026nbsp;voice, as well as full support for the entire portfolio of Amazon Polly\u0027s Neural and Standard voices in the AWS Africa (Cape Town) Region. With this launch, the service now supports 31 languages including 7 different varieties of English. Neural TTS voices are available in 12 AWS Regions.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-polly","description":"general:products/aws-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:30:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:30:10+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-08-amazon-polly-launches-aria-new-zealand-english-neural-text-speech-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/08/amazon-polly-launches-aria-new-zealand-english-neural-text-speech-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:30:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:04:20+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Aria, Polly’s first New Zealand English voice. Aria is a neural text-to-speech (NTTS) voice that is expressive, natural and easy to follow. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use Amazon Polly to enhance the user experience and improve the accessibility of your text content with the power of voice. Common use cases include newsreaders, audiobooks, eLearning content, virtual assistants, and interactive voice response (IVR) systems. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with Aria, please log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. For more details, review our full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-08-24T16:46:53Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/08/amazon-polly-launches-aria-new-zealand-english-neural-text-speech-voice/","postDateTime":"2021-08-24T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches Aria, a New Zealand English neural text-to-speech voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Aria, Polly’s first New Zealand English voice. Aria is a neural text-to-speech (NTTS) voice that is expressive, natural and easy to follow. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-polly","description":"general:products/aws-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:30:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:30:10+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-06-amazon-polly-launches-a-new-german-neural-text-to-speech-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/06/amazon-polly-launches-a-new-german-neural-text-to-speech-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:45:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:06:42+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of the Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) version of Vicki, a German Polly voice. Now, Amazon Polly customers can enjoy Vicki either as an NTTS or a Standard German voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, review our full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e. To get started, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to give Vicki a try.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-06-15T18:13:47Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/06/amazon-polly-launches-a-new-german-neural-text-to-speech-voice/","postDateTime":"2021-06-15T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Launches a new German Neural Text-to-Speech voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of the Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) version of Vicki, a German Polly voice. Now, Amazon Polly customers can enjoy Vicki either as an NTTS or a Standard German voice.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-05-aws-solutions-implementations-serverless-bot-framework-adds-new-integrations-for-customers-to-expand-the-use-of-their-amazon-lex-chatbots","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/05/aws-solutions-implementations-serverless-bot-framework-adds-new-integrations-for-customers-to-expand-the-use-of-their-amazon-lex-chatbots/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:40:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:29:24+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAWS has updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/implementations/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e, an AWS Solutions Implementation that allows customers to automatically set up a chatbot application with sample interactions. The new functionalities help customers scale the use of their chatbots with integrations with AWS Lambda and Amazon DynamoDB.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe solution now enables customers to explore three types of Amazon Lex V2 integration with AWS Lambda. First, it enables the chatbot to use an AWS Lambda function for intent fulfillment and for storing the intent data into an Amazon DynamoDB table. Second, it enables the chatbot to use an AWS Lambda function for slot validation by retrieving data from Amazon DynamoDB. Third, it allows the chatbot to connect to an external API via an AWS Lambda function. \u003cbr /\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Lex V2 offers multiple languages in a single bot, easy addition of a new language to an existing bot, sentiment analysis of requests sent to the bot, support for bi-directional streaming features such as barge-in and configurable timeout. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is also used to convert text to life-like speech in this solutions.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/implementations/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Solutions Implementation webpage\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to learn more about Serverless Bot Framework on AWS. For more details on the Amazon Lex integration, please see \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2021/01/launching-amazon-lex-v2-console-apis-improved-bot-building-experience/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Lex Introduces an Enhanced Console Experience and New V2 APIs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAdditional AWS Solutions are available on the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/implementations/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Solutions Implementation webpage\u003c/a\u003e, where customers can browse solutions by product category or industry to find AWS-vetted, automated, turnkey reference implementations that address specific business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-05-19T19:36:21Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/05/aws-solutions-implementations-serverless-bot-framework-adds-new-integrations-for-customers-to-expand-the-use-of-their-amazon-lex-chatbots/","postDateTime":"2021-05-19T04:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"AWS Solutions Implementations - Serverless Bot Framework adds new integrations for customers to expand the use of their Amazon Lex chatbots","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAWS has updated \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/solutions/implementations/serverless-bot-framework.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e, an AWS Solutions Implementation that allows customers to automatically set up a chatbot application with sample interactions. The new functionalities help customers scale the use of their chatbots with integrations with AWS Lambda and Amazon DynamoDB.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-solution","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-solution","description":"general:products/aws-solution","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:47+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-lex","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-lex","description":"general:products/amazon-lex","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-lambda","description":"general:products/aws-lambda","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T20:18:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T20:18:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2021-03-amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-canada-seoul","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/03/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-canada-seoul/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:43:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:07:57+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Canada (Central) and Asia Pacific (Seoul) Regions. You can now synthesize all NTTS voices in this Region, including the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e speaking styles. In addition, you can continue to synthesize over 60 standard voices available in 29 languages in the Amazon Polly portfolio. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly voices can be applied to a diverse set of use cases to increase customer engagement. This includes giving virtual contact center agents natural sounding voices or producing spoken versions of text-based content. In the e-learning space, you can also provide enhanced audio/visual experiences by synchronizing speech with facial animation or karaoke-style word highlighting.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eupdated FAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2021-03-25T17:53:24Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2021/03/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-canada-seoul/","postDateTime":"2021-03-25T16:45:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly NTTS voices now available in Canada (Central), and Asia Pacific (Seoul)","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Canada (Central) and Asia Pacific (Seoul) Regions. You can now synthesize all NTTS voices in this Region, including the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e speaking styles. In addition, you can continue to synthesize over 60 standard voices available in 29 languages in the Amazon Polly portfolio. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2021","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2021","description":"year#2021","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:24:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-11-amazon-polly-launches-new-australian-english-neural-text-to-speech-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/11/amazon-polly-launches-new-australian-english-neural-text-to-speech-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:07:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:19:53+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Olivia, Polly’s first Australian English voice, available via Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS). Thanks to its unique vocal personality, the voice sounds expressive, natural and it is easy to follow. Amazon Polly customers can now enjoy a selection of three Australian English voices: Russell, Nicole and Olivia.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-11-12T18:41:54Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/11/amazon-polly-launches-new-australian-english-neural-text-to-speech-voice/","postDateTime":"2020-11-12T11:06:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches a new Australian English neural text-to-speech voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Olivia, Polly’s first Australian English voice, available via Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS). Thanks to its unique vocal personality, the voice sounds expressive, natural and it is easy to follow. Amazon Polly customers can now enjoy a selection of three Australian English voices: Russell, Nicole and Olivia.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-11-amazon-polly-launches-british-english-newscaster-speaking-style","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/11/amazon-polly-launches-british-english-newscaster-speaking-style/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:12:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:11:03+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of our brand-new British Newscaster speaking style voice – Amy. The speaking style mimics a formal and authoritative British newsreader and it is the result of our latest achievements in Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-11-10T19:52:50Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/11/amazon-polly-launches-british-english-newscaster-speaking-style/","postDateTime":"2020-11-10T12:28:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches a British English Newscaster speaking Style","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of our brand-new British Newscaster speaking style voice – Amy. The speaking style mimics a formal and authoritative British newsreader and it is the result of our latest achievements in Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-09-amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-london-tokyo-frankfurt-singapore-regions","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-london-tokyo-frankfurt-singapore-regions/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:58:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:01:10+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is\u0026nbsp;a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asian Pacific (Tokyo), EU (Frankfurt), and EU (London) Regions. You can now synthesize over 14 NTTS voices in these Regions, including the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices/\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e speaking styles. In addition, you can continue to synthesize the over 60 standard voices available in 29 languages in the Amazon Polly portfolio. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-09-03T17:41:56Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/09/amazon-polly-ntts-voices-available-london-tokyo-frankfurt-singapore-regions/","postDateTime":"2020-09-03T11:40:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly NTTS voices now available in Singapore, Tokyo, Frankfurt, and London Regions","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is\u0026nbsp;a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asian Pacific (Tokyo), EU (Frankfurt), and EU (London) Regions. You can now synthesize over 14 NTTS voices in these Regions, including the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices.html\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices/\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e speaking styles. In addition, you can continue to synthesize the over 60 standard voices available in 29 languages in the Amazon Polly portfolio. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-07-amazon-connect-supports-speaking-styles-with-neural-text-to-speech-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/07/amazon-connect-supports-speaking-styles-with-neural-text-to-speech-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:54:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:06:38+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now adapt Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech (TTS) voices to the context of your customer conversation. For example, the TTS voice Matthew can be adapted to be more relatable for a welcome prompt and take on a formal persona when informing customers of their bank balance. These speaking styles allow businesses to design more engaging and relatable interactions. The Conversational and Newscaster speaking styles are currently available with the Joanna and Matthew voices. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis feature is available in the US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), and Asia Pacific (Sydney) \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regions_az/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregions\u003c/a\u003e and is included in the Amazon Connect service. There is no additional charge for using neural Text-to-Speech voices. To learn more, see the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/connect/latest/adminguide/set-voice.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ehelp documentation\u003c/a\u003e, or visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/connect/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Connect website\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-07-27T20:11:25Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/07/amazon-connect-supports-speaking-styles-with-neural-text-to-speech-voices/","postDateTime":"2020-07-24T12:23:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Connect supports speaking styles with neural Text-to-Speech voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now adapt Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech (TTS) voices to the context of your customer conversation. For example, the TTS voice Matthew can be adapted to be more relatable for a welcome prompt and take on a formal persona when informing customers of their bank balance. These speaking styles allow businesses to design more engaging and relatable interactions. The Conversational and Newscaster speaking styles are currently available with the Joanna and Matthew voices. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-connect","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-connect","description":"general:products/amazon-connect","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:51:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:51:35+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-06-amazon-polly-launches-a-child-us-english-ntts-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/06/amazon-polly-launches-a-child-us-english-ntts-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:59:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:32:23+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of another child US English voice - Kevin. Kevin’s voice was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology, and imitates the voice of a male child. Amazon Polly offers 14 neural voices across 4 languages - US English (en-US), British English (en-GB), Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR), and US Spanish (es-US). NTTS voices are supported in the following regions: US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), EU (Ireland) and Asia Pacific (Sydney). \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/\"\u003eAmazon Polly features page\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-06-16T18:06:13Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/06/amazon-polly-launches-a-child-us-english-ntts-voice/","postDateTime":"2020-06-16T10:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches a child US English NTTS Voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of another child US English voice - Kevin. Kevin’s voice was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology, and imitates the voice of a male child. Amazon Polly offers 14 neural voices across 4 languages - US English (en-US), British English (en-GB), Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR), and US Spanish (es-US). NTTS voices are supported in the following regions: US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon), EU (Ireland) and Asia Pacific (Sydney). \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-04-amazon-polly-launches-spanish-newscaster-style-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/04/amazon-polly-launches-spanish-newscaster-style-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:05:53+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of US Spanish Newscaster speaking style voice. The Newscaster speaking style was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech technology, and imitates the voice of a news anchor. The US Spanish voice is the second language launched by Polly in the Newscaster speaking style, following the release of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster speaking style voices\u003c/a\u003e in US English in July 2019.\u0026nbsp;To hear an audio sample of the US Spanish Newscaster voice click \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/lupe_blog_news_new416.73d2147e6ec4c01a015dad01c384310409dd19e4.mp3\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003efeatures page\u003c/a\u003e, Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003econsole\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-04-16T17:44:41Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/04/amazon-polly-launches-spanish-newscaster-style-voice/","postDateTime":"2020-04-16T12:39:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches Spanish Newscaster style voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of US Spanish Newscaster speaking style voice. The Newscaster speaking style was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech technology, and imitates the voice of a news anchor. The US Spanish voice is the second language launched by Polly in the Newscaster speaking style, following the release of \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster speaking style voices\u003c/a\u003e in US English in July 2019.\u0026nbsp;To hear an audio sample of the US Spanish Newscaster voice click \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/lupe_blog_news_new416.73d2147e6ec4c01a015dad01c384310409dd19e4.mp3\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-02-amazon-polly-launches-brand-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/02/amazon-polly-launches-brand-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:05:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:02:12+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and offers over 60 publicly available voices in 29 languages. AWS is excited to announce a new feature in Amazon Polly called Brand Voice, a feature where customers can engage the Amazon Polly team to build custom high-quality Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices that represent the customer’s brand persona. Polly’s Brand Voices are created for the exclusive use of the customer, allowing them to differentiate themselves by incorporating a unique vocal identity into the products and services that they offer to their end users.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please read the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/build-a-unique-brand-voice-with-amazon-polly/\"\u003eBrand Voice blog post\u003c/a\u003e or visit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/#Brand_Voice\"\u003efeatures page\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-02-04T17:54:47Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/02/amazon-polly-launches-brand-voice/","postDateTime":"2020-02-04T12:03:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Launches Brand Voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and offers over 60 publicly available voices in 29 languages. AWS is excited to announce a new feature in Amazon Polly called Brand Voice, a feature where customers can engage the Amazon Polly team to build custom high-quality Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices that represent the customer’s brand persona. Polly’s Brand Voices are created for the exclusive use of the customer, allowing them to differentiate themselves by incorporating a unique vocal identity into the products and services that they offer to their end users.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2020-01-amazon-polly-launches-in-bah-and-hkg-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/01/amazon-polly-launches-in-bah-and-hkg-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:57:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:02:03+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Amazon Polly standard voices in the Middle East (BAH) and Asia Pacific (HKG) region. Customers in these regions can now synthesize 60+ standard voices available in 29 languages in the Polly portfolio. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2020-01-15T20:25:32Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2020/01/amazon-polly-launches-in-bah-and-hkg-region/","postDateTime":"2020-01-15T10:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches in Middle East (BAH) and Asia Pacific (HKG) regions","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Amazon Polly standard voices in the Middle East (BAH) and Asia Pacific (HKG) region. Customers in these regions can now synthesize 60+ standard voices available in 29 languages in the Polly portfolio. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2020","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2020","description":"year#2020","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:50:17+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-12-amazon-launches-neural-text-to-speech-voices-in-syd-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/12/amazon-launches-neural-text-to-speech-voices-in-syd-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:09:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:48:13+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Asia Pacific (Sydney) region. NTTS voices, which deliver ground-breaking improvements in speech quality through a new machine learning approach, are also available in US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon) and Europe (Ireland). Customers in these four regions can now synthesize 13 NTTS voices (8 US English, 3 UK English, 1 US Spanish and 1 Brazilian Portuguese) in the Polly portfolio. In addition, 2 speaking style voices - \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/features/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e, built using NTTS technology are also available in US English (Matthew and Joanna) starting today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-12-11T18:16:21Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/12/amazon-launches-neural-text-to-speech-voices-in-syd-region/","postDateTime":"2019-12-11T11:02:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon launches Neural Text to Speech voices in SYD region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of all Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) voices in the Asia Pacific (Sydney) region. NTTS voices, which deliver ground-breaking improvements in speech quality through a new machine learning approach, are also available in US East (N. Virginia), US West (Oregon) and Europe (Ireland). Customers in these four regions can now synthesize 13 NTTS voices (8 US English, 3 UK English, 1 US Spanish and 1 Brazilian Portuguese) in the Polly portfolio. In addition, 2 speaking style voices - \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly/features.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eNewscaster\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/engage-listeners-with-amazon-pollys-conversational-speaking-style-voices/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eConversational\u003c/a\u003e, built using NTTS technology are also available in US English (Matthew and Joanna) starting today.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-11-amazon-polly-launches-conversational-speaking-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/11/amazon-polly-launches-conversational-speaking-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:20:55+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of our first Conversational speaking style voices.\u0026nbsp;This speaking style was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech  technology, and the voices were designed to sound natural, friendly,  and approachable in a dialog. The Conversational speaking style can be used with the US English voices Matthew and Joanna, and is the second speaking style launched by Polly, following the release of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/\"\u003eNewscaster Speaking Style voices\u003c/a\u003e in US English in July 2019.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-11-25T20:11:08Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/11/amazon-polly-launches-conversational-speaking-voices/","postDateTime":"2019-11-25T07:42:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly launches Conversational Speaking Style voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, and today we are excited to announce the general availability of our first Conversational speaking style voices.\u0026nbsp;This speaking style was developed using the latest Neural Text-to-Speech  technology, and the voices were designed to sound natural, friendly,  and approachable in a dialog. The Conversational speaking style can be used with the US English voices Matthew and Joanna, and is the second speaking style launched by Polly, following the release of \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices.html\"\u003eNewscaster Speaking Style voices\u003c/a\u003e in US English in July 2019.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-10-aws-for-wordpress-plugin-now-available-and-with-new-amazon-cloudfront-workflow","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/10/aws-for-wordpress-plugin-now-available-and-with-new-amazon-cloudfront-workflow/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:10:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:17:24+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Web Services announces the general availability of the AWS for WordPress plugin. Previously known as the Amazon Polly and Amazon AI plugin, the new AWS for WordPress plugin now provides a workflow to configure an Amazon CloudFront distribution that is highly optimized for WordPress websites.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon CloudFront, AWS’s content delivery network, accelerates the performance of your website by using a global network of 200 edge locations to cache and deliver content closer to your viewers. The plugin’s new CloudFront workflow creates a distribution with multiple cache behaviors, each one tailored to serving varying types of content for the best viewer and administrator experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/amazon-polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS for WordPress plugin is free to download\u003c/a\u003e from the WordPress Plugin Directory; standard charges apply for using AWS services. Existing users of the plugin who want to use the new CloudFront workflow will need to update the IAM policy for their plugin’s IAM user. Refer to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/WordPressPlugIn.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eCloudFront Developer Guide\u003c/a\u003e for more information about creating an updated IAM policy using the new managed IAM policy named \u003ci\u003eAWSforWordPressPluginPolicy\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRead our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/networking-and-content-delivery/accelerating-wordpress-with-cloudfront-using-the-aws-for-wordpress-plugin/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eblog post\u003c/a\u003e for a detailed guide to self-hosting WordPress with AWS and using the new CloudFront workflow within the plugin. Also read our newly updated whitepaper, “\u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/whitepapers/wordpress-best-practices-on-aws.pdf\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWordPress: Best Practices on AWS\u003c/a\u003e”, for more information about creating highly-scalable WordPress websites on AWS.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-30T17:17:23Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/10/aws-for-wordpress-plugin-now-available-and-with-new-amazon-cloudfront-workflow/","postDateTime":"2019-10-30T17:08:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"AWS for WordPress plugin now available and with new Amazon CloudFront workflow","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Web Services announces the general availability of the AWS for WordPress plugin. Previously known as the Amazon Polly and Amazon AI plugin, the new AWS for WordPress plugin now provides a workflow to configure an Amazon CloudFront distribution that is highly optimized for WordPress websites.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-translate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-translate","description":"general:products/amazon-translate","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:57:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:57:25+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-cloudfront","description":"general:products/amazon-cloudfront","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:54:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:54:57+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-10-amazon-polly-launches-two-new-voices-neural-text-to-speech-technology","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/10/amazon-polly-launches-two-new-voices-neural-text-to-speech-technology/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:08:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:16:33+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Following the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/\"\u003eJuly 30th launch\u003c/a\u003e of 8 US English and 3 UK English voices,   we are excited to announce the general availability of the first US Spanish (Lupe) and Brazilian Portuguese (Camila) NTTS voices. Both the voices are now available as Neural TTS voices, as well as Standard TTS voices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-23T18:14:02Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/10/amazon-polly-launches-two-new-voices-neural-text-to-speech-technology/","postDateTime":"2019-10-23T09:40:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Launches two new voices in Neural Text-to-Speech technology","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Following the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices.html\"\u003eJuly 30th launch\u003c/a\u003e of 8 US English and 3 UK English voices,   we are excited to announce the general availability of the first US Spanish (Lupe) and Brazilian Portuguese (Camila) NTTS voices. Both the voices are now available as Neural TTS voices, as well as Standard TTS voices.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-producer#customer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-producer","name":"customer","description":"general:producer/customer","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:50+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-09-amazon-polly-voices-available-in-windows-applications","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/09/amazon-polly-voices-available-in-windows-applications/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:18:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:29:32+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the release of Amazon Polly for Windows, an open-source engine that allows users to take advantage of Amazon Polly voices in SAPI-compliant Windows applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSAPI (Speech Application Programming Interface) is a Microsoft Windows API that allows desktop applications to implement speech synthesis. When an application supports SAPI, it can access any of the installed SAPI voices to generate speech. Out of the box, Microsoft Windows provides one SAPI male and female voice that can be used in any supported voice application. With Amazon Polly for Windows, users can install over 50 additional voices across over 25 languages, paying only for what they use. For more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\"\u003epricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T05:02:34Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/09/amazon-polly-voices-available-in-windows-applications/","postDateTime":"2019-09-26T10:41:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Voices available in Windows applications","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the release of Amazon Polly for Windows, an open-source engine that allows users to take advantage of Amazon Polly voices in SAPI-compliant Windows applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-07-amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:13:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:22:10+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology, which delivers ground-breaking improvements in speech quality through a new machine learning approach. The 8 US English and 3 UK English voices in the Polly portfolio are now available in both the previous Standard technology, as well as in the new Neural TTS technology. In addition, 2 of the US English voices also feature a Newscaster speaking style, which sounds like a TV or radio newscaster.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e, check the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out, and review our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\"\u003eNeural TTS pricing\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eregional availability\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/limits.html\"\u003eservice limits\u003c/a\u003e, and updated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/faqs/\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T05:01:46Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/07/amazon-polly-launches-neural-text-to-speech-and-newscaster-voices/","postDateTime":"2019-07-30T16:17:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Launches Neural Text-to-Speech and Newscaster Voices","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce the general availability of Neural Text-to-Speech (NTTS) technology, which delivers ground-breaking improvements in speech quality through a new machine learning approach. The 8 US English and 3 UK English voices in the Polly portfolio are now available in both the previous Standard technology, as well as in the new Neural TTS technology. In addition, 2 of the US English voices also feature a Newscaster speaking style, which sounds like a TV or radio newscaster.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-04-amazon-polly-adds-arabic-language-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/04/amazon-polly-adds-arabic-language-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:07:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:11:41+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce Zeina, the first Arabic voice for Amazon Polly. Zeina is a clear and natural-sounding female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsed by over 400 million people, Arabic is one of the most spoken languages in the world. It consists of 30 dialects, including its universal form, which is Modern Standard Arabic (MSA). Zeina follows the MSA pronunciation, which is the common broadcasting standard across the region. MSA might sometimes sound formal because it differs from day-to-day speaking style. However, it’s the linguistic thread that links the Arabic native-speakers worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly customers who plan to use Zeina’s voice include Emirates NBD - a leading bank in the Middle East who has introduced an AI powered virtual assistant, Duolingo - a globally operating eLearning platform offering a portfolio of 84 language courses for more than 30 distinct languages, and iTranslate - a leading translation and dictionary app that offers text translation as well as voice-to-voice conversations in over 100 languages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the addition of Arabic language support, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 59 voices across 29 languages. You can check out the full list in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003eVoices in Amazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e section of our documentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T05:00:14Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/04/amazon-polly-adds-arabic-language-support/","postDateTime":"2019-04-17T07:55:35Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Adds Arabic Language Support","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce Zeina, the first Arabic voice for Amazon Polly. Zeina is a clear and natural-sounding female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsed by over 400 million people, Arabic is one of the most spoken languages in the world. It consists of 30 dialects, including its universal form, which is Modern Standard Arabic (MSA). Zeina follows the MSA pronunciation, which is the common broadcasting standard across the region. MSA might sometimes sound formal because it differs from day-to-day speaking style. However, it’s the linguistic thread that links the Arabic native-speakers worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly customers who plan to use Zeina’s voice include Emirates NBD - a leading bank in the Middle East who has introduced an AI powered virtual assistant, Duolingo - a globally operating eLearning platform offering a portfolio of 84 language courses for more than 30 distinct languages, and iTranslate - a leading translation and dictionary app that offers text translation as well as voice-to-voice conversations in over 100 languages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the addition of Arabic language support, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 59 voices across 29 languages. You can check out the full list in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\"\u003eVoices in Amazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e section of our documentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2019-02-amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-the-aws-europe-stockholm-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/02/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-the-aws-europe-stockholm-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:06:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:17:17+0000","additionalFields":{"modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:59:38Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2019/02/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-the-aws-europe-stockholm-region/","postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is an AWS service that turns text into lifelike speech. Starting today, Amazon Polly is available in the AWS EU (Stockholm) Region. With this launch, the service is now available in 18 regions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers in the following regions can now experience higher stability and lower latency when using Amazon Polly: Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Ningxia), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Montreal), EU (Frankfurt), EU (Ireland), EU (London), EU (Paris), EU (Stockholm), South America (São Paulo), US East (GovCloud), US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (N. California), and US West (Oregon). Refer to\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eGlobal Infrastructure page\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;for the latest list.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly offers 57 voices across 28 languages. Try them all out on our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly Console\u003c/a\u003e. You can start your own voiced application with the help of our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/documentation/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://forums.aws.amazon.com/forum.jspa?forumID\u003d235\u0026amp;start\u003d0\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eShare your feedback\u003c/a\u003e with us! Let us know which additional language support you’d like us to offer, or describe the voice you’d like us to release next! Your input helps shape our roadmap, so that we can better meet your needs. If you have questions or suggestions, please leave a comment.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","postDateTime":"2019-02-06T16:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly is now available in the AWS Europe (Stockholm) Region"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2019","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2019","description":"year#2019","dateCreated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-06T18:17:49+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-11-amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-china-ningxia-region-operated-by-nwcd","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/11/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-china-ningxia-region-operated-by-nwcd/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:36:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:02:30+0000","additionalFields":{"modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:58:24Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/11/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-china-ningxia-region-operated-by-nwcd/","postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech and enables you to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products by adding a voice. Starting today, Amazon Polly is available in AWS China (Ningxia) Region, operated by NWCD.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers can choose from 57 Polly voices across 28 languages. We announced Zhiyu, the first Mandarin Chinese voice earlier this month. You can check out the full list in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eVoices in Amazon Polly section\u003c/a\u003e of the documentation.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started, you would need an AWS (China) account. You can request an AWS (China) account by completing \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/sign-up/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ethis form\u003c/a\u003e. Once you have an account, log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.amazonaws.cn/console/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Management Console\u003c/a\u003e to try the service with your own text.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","postDateTime":"2018-11-14T12:19:43Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly is now Available in AWS China (Ningxia) Region, Operated by NWCD"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-11-amazon-polly-adds-italian-and-castilian-spanish-voices-and-mexican-spanish-language-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/11/amazon-polly-adds-italian-and-castilian-spanish-voices-and-mexican-spanish-language-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:41:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:55:41+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce additional Italian and Spanish voice options.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the previously available Italian voices Carla and Giorgio, we have now added a second female Italian voice. Complementing the voices Conchita and Enrique, we have now added a second female Castilian Spanish voice. We are also expanding our portfolio of Spanish options, which has included Castilian Spanish and US Spanish.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith these additions, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 57 voices across 28 languages. Visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for the full list of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003etext-to-speech voices\u003c/a\u003e, and log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to try them out.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:58:22Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/11/amazon-polly-adds-italian-and-castilian-spanish-voices-and-mexican-spanish-language-support/","postDateTime":"2018-11-12T00:14:31Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Adds Italian and Castilian Spanish Voices, and Mexican Spanish Language Support","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce additional Italian and Spanish voice options.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-09-amazon-polly-adds-mandarin-chinese-language-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/09/amazon-polly-adds-mandarin-chinese-language-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:24:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:19:13+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce Zhiyu, the first Mandarin Chinese voice. Zhiyu is a clear, bright, and natural-sounding female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/zhiyu-intro.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eListen to Zhiyu’s voice.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsed by over 1 billion people worldwide, Mandarin Chinese is one of the most spoken languages in the world. It has been one of the most requested languages and our customers are already integrating it into their applications. For example, Yunan Beifei has integrated Zhiyu into their education application that empower children in the rural areas to acquire literacy through their mobile platform. Netvue is another customer who has brought Zhiyu’s voice into their AI-enabled doorbell called Belle, which automatically interacts with a person at the door using the natural-sounding Polly voice.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the addition of Mandarin Chinese language support, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 54 voices across 27 languages. You can check out the full list in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eVoices in Amazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e section of our documentation. Amazon Polly will be available in the AWS China (Ningxia) Region before the end of the year. You can see the currently supported AWS Regions \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:57:47Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/09/amazon-polly-adds-mandarin-chinese-language-support/","postDateTime":"2018-09-14T03:13:28Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Adds Mandarin Chinese Language Support ","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Today, we are excited to announce Zhiyu, the first Mandarin Chinese voice. Zhiyu is a clear, bright, and natural-sounding female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-08-amazon-polly-adds-bilingual-indian-english-hindi-language-support","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/08/amazon-polly-adds-bilingual-indian-english-hindi-language-support/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:27:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:01:14+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e  Amazon Polly is an AWS service that turns text into lifelike speech. We\u0027re excited to announce new Hindi language support and the release of our first bilingual voice. Aditi is a female voice that speaks Hindi and Indian English fluently.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  Used by over 500 million people worldwide, Hindi is one of the most widely spoken languages in the world. Aditi was first released as an Indian English voice to the Amazon Polly text-to-speech portfolio in November 2017. In response to customer requests for Hindi language support and a bilingual voice, Aditi provides high-quality speech synthesis in both Hindi and Indian English. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHindi and Indian English are two of the official languages of India, and there is a high demand for Indian English/Hindi content in all genres of voice applications, from explainer videos to e-Learning, corporate narration, and more. For example, Duolingo, a popular language-learning platform, recently unveiled its latest \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.duolingo.com/course/hi/en/Learn-Hindi-Online\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eHindi course\u003c/a\u003e for English speakers, which was developed using the new Aditi voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  With the addition of the Hindi language support, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 53 voices across 26 languages. For the full list of text-to-speech voices, refer to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eVoices in Amazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e section in documentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:57:25Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/08/amazon-polly-adds-bilingual-indian-english-hindi-language-support/","postDateTime":"2018-08-02T13:37:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Adds Bilingual Indian English/Hindi Language Support","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e  Amazon Polly is an AWS service that turns text into lifelike speech. We\u0027re excited to announce new Hindi language support and the release of our first bilingual voice. Aditi is a female voice that speaks Hindi and Indian English fluently.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-07-introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:34:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:53:35+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e is a solution that helps AWS customers implement chatbots in other languages without having to develop their own backend platforms that support language analysis and abstraction, and knowledge training. The solution integrates with managed services such as AWS Lambda, to apply machine learning algorithms, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, to turn text into lifelike speech.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe solution deploys an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/api-gateway/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon API Gateway\u003c/a\u003e endpoint where customers can send requests, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/lambda/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Lambda\u003c/a\u003e functions that apply machine learning algorithms, Amazon Polly to turn text into lifelike speech, an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/dynamodb/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon DynamoDB\u003c/a\u003e table to store conversation logs and interaction context, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/s3/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon S3\u003c/a\u003e buckets to store configuration files. The solution also includes a sample web application that you can use as a reference framework to create your own application that fits your business need. For more information, see the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003esolution webpage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe AWS Solutions team communicates AWS architectural best practices and develops standardized, automated solutions for the platform. Our offerings currently live on the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Answers webpage\u003c/a\u003e, where customers can browse common questions by category to find answers in the form of succinct Solution Briefs or comprehensive Solutions, which are AWS-vetted, automated, turnkey reference implementations that address specific business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:57:15Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework/","postDateTime":"2018-07-25T15:23:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Introducing the Serverless Bot Framework","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e is a solution that helps AWS customers implement chatbots in other languages without having to develop their own backend platforms that support language analysis and abstraction, and knowledge training. The solution integrates with managed services such as AWS Lambda, to apply machine learning algorithms, and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, to turn text into lifelike speech.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe solution deploys an \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/api-gateway.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon API Gateway\u003c/a\u003e endpoint where customers can send requests, \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/lambda.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Lambda\u003c/a\u003e functions that apply machine learning algorithms, Amazon Polly to turn text into lifelike speech, an \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/dynamodb.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon DynamoDB\u003c/a\u003e table to store conversation logs and interaction context, and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/s3.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon S3\u003c/a\u003e buckets to store configuration files. The solution also includes a sample web application that you can use as a reference framework to create your own application that fits your business need. For more information, see the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003esolution webpage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe AWS Solutions team communicates AWS architectural best practices and develops standardized, automated solutions for the platform. Our offerings currently live on the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Answers webpage\u003c/a\u003e, where customers can browse common questions by category to find answers in the form of succinct Solution Briefs or comprehensive Solutions, which are AWS-vetted, automated, turnkey reference implementations that address specific business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-lex","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-lex","description":"general:products/amazon-lex","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general#products","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general","name":"products","description":"general:products","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:59:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:59:34+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-cognito","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-cognito","description":"general:products/amazon-cognito","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:55:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:55:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-04-introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/04/introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:51:17+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e is a solution that helps AWS customers implement chatbots in other languages without having to develop their own backend platforms that support language analysis and abstraction, and knowledge training. The solution integrates with managed services such as AWS Lambda, to apply machine learning algorithms, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, to turn text into lifelike speech.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe solution deploys an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/api-gateway/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon API Gateway\u003c/a\u003e endpoint where customers can send requests, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/lambda/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Lambda\u003c/a\u003e functions that apply machine learning algorithms, Amazon Polly to turn text into lifelike speech, an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/dynamodb/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon DynamoDB\u003c/a\u003e table to store conversation logs and interaction context, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/s3/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon S3\u003c/a\u003e buckets to store configuration files. The solution also includes a sample web application that you can use as a reference framework to create your own application that fits your business need. For more information, see the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003esolution webpage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe AWS Solutions team communicates AWS architectural best practices and develops standardized, automated solutions for the platform. Our offerings currently live on the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/answers/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Answers webpage\u003c/a\u003e, where customers can browse common questions by category to find answers in the form of succinct Solution Briefs or comprehensive Solutions, which are AWS-vetted, automated, turnkey reference implementations that address specific business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:11Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/04/introducing-the-serverless-bot-framework/","postDateTime":"2018-07-24T15:23:31Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Introducing the Serverless Bot Framework","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eServerless Bot Framework\u003c/a\u003e is a solution that helps AWS customers implement chatbots in other languages without having to develop their own backend platforms that support language analysis and abstraction, and knowledge training. The solution integrates with managed services such as AWS Lambda, to apply machine learning algorithms, and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/polly.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, to turn text into lifelike speech.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe solution deploys an \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/api-gateway.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon API Gateway\u003c/a\u003e endpoint where customers can send requests, \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/lambda.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Lambda\u003c/a\u003e functions that apply machine learning algorithms, Amazon Polly to turn text into lifelike speech, an \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/dynamodb.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon DynamoDB\u003c/a\u003e table to store conversation logs and interaction context, and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/s3.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon S3\u003c/a\u003e buckets to store configuration files. The solution also includes a sample web application that you can use as a reference framework to create your own application that fits your business need. For more information, see the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers/machine-learning/serverless-bot-framework.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003esolution webpage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe AWS Solutions team communicates AWS architectural best practices and develops standardized, automated solutions for the platform. Our offerings currently live on the \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/answers.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Answers webpage\u003c/a\u003e, where customers can browse common questions by category to find answers in the form of succinct Solution Briefs or comprehensive Solutions, which are AWS-vetted, automated, turnkey reference implementations that address specific business needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-lex","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-lex","description":"general:products/amazon-lex","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general#products","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general","name":"products","description":"general:products","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:59:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:59:34+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-cognito","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-cognito","description":"general:products/amazon-cognito","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:55:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:55:30+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-07-amazon-polly-now-supports-input-character-limit-of-100k-and-stores-output-files-in-s3","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/amazon-polly-now-supports-input-character-limit-of-100k-and-stores-output-files-in-s3/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:22:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:50:12+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns texts into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled applications. Starting today, you can put up to 100,000 characters in an input text using the new asynchronous synthesis task and store the output files in S3. This greatly simplifies the process of voicing long form content like news articles and documents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsynchronous synthesis tasks also enable you to incorporate robust Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) tags. Input text can now also contain up to 100,000 characters of SSML tags, and they won’t count towards character limit for input text. This allows for a very high degree of control over the style and expressiveness of large bodies of text, such as blog posts, articles, or even book chapters.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry the new asynchronous synthesis feature through the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e, or visit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/asynchronous.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information about the Command Line Interface (CLI) and AWS SDKs. You can also read more about this feature on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/amazon-polly-update-time-driven-prosody-and-asynchronous-synthesis\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eJeff Barr’s Blog\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:57:12Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/amazon-polly-now-supports-input-character-limit-of-100k-and-stores-output-files-in-s3/","postDateTime":"2018-07-17T00:21:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Now Supports Input Character Limit of 100K and Stores Output Files in S3","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a service that turns texts into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled applications. Starting today, you can put up to 100,000 characters in an input text using the new asynchronous synthesis task and store the output files in S3. This greatly simplifies the process of voicing long form content like news articles and documents.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-07-amazon-polly-now-lets-you-define-the-maximum-amount-of-time-for-speech-to-complete","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/amazon-polly-now-lets-you-define-the-maximum-amount-of-time-for-speech-to-complete/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:34:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:56:25+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns texts into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled applications. Today, Amazon Polly is releasing a new feature, time-driven prosody, which automatically adjusts the speech rate based on a maximum allotted amount of time you define.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis feature is beneficial for many use cases, especially when it comes to localization. For example, suppose you have US English speech embedded in your training video and want to localize this video into German. Let’s say you translate the text using \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/translate/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Translate\u003c/a\u003e and voice it with Polly. It is essential that the localized German speech streams in corresponding frames of the video, so the German speech cannot be longer than the US English speech. You can use this new feature to more easily facilitate the dubbing process.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry the new time-driven prosody feature through the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e, or visit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#maxduration-tag\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information about the Command Line Interface (CLI) and AWS SDKs. You can also read more about this feature on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/amazon-polly-update-time-driven-prosody-and-asynchronous-synthesis\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eJeff Barr’s Blog\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:57:12Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/07/amazon-polly-now-lets-you-define-the-maximum-amount-of-time-for-speech-to-complete/","postDateTime":"2018-07-17T00:21:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Now Lets You Define the Maximum Amount of Time for Speech to Complete","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns texts into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled applications. Today, Amazon Polly is releasing a new feature, time-driven prosody, which automatically adjusts the speech rate based on a maximum allotted amount of time you define.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-06-amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-french-female-voice-lea","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/06/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-french-female-voice-lea/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:26:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:57:24+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers a choice of a second female French voice, Léa, in addition to the current female voice, Celine. Amazon Polly also has a French male voice, Mathieu. Léa is a warm and natural-sounding voice with Parisian accent.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/lea_intro.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eListen to the spoken introduction from Lea.\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  With the addition of this new female French voice, the Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 53 voices across 25 languages. Visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e and navigate to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAvailable Voices page\u003c/a\u003e for the full list of Text-to-Speech voices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLéa is now available globally in 16 AWS Regions: Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Central), EU (Frankfurt), EU (Ireland), EU (London), EU (Paris), South America (São Paulo), US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (N. California), and US West (Oregon), and GovCloud.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLog in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and try the different Amazon Polly voices, today! \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:48Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/06/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-french-female-voice-lea/","postDateTime":"2018-06-05T21:39:39Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Introduces a New French Female Voice, Léa","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly now offers a choice of a second female French voice, Léa, in addition to the current female voice, Celine. Amazon Polly also has a French male voice, Mathieu. Léa is a warm and natural-sounding voice with Parisian accent.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/dam/product-marketing/Polly/voices/lea_intro.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eListen to the spoken introduction from Lea.\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-06-enable-multilingual-wordpress-content-with-the-updated-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/06/enable-multilingual-wordpress-content-with-the-updated-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:37:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:01:46+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e  The Amazon Polly Plugin for WordPress can now automatically translate text to different languages, and convert the written content into multilingual audio formats. This new feature is powered by Amazon Translate, a neural machine translation service.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProviding multilingual content represents a great opportunity for site owners. Although English is the dominant language of the web, native English speakers are a mere 26% of the total online audience. Make your web content more accessible with text-to-speech and machine translation. By offering written and audio versions of your WordPress content in multiple languages, you can meet the needs of a larger international audience.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRead our latest \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/building-your-personal-translator-with-amazon-translate-and-amazon-polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eblog post\u003c/a\u003e to learn more about the updated Amazon Polly plugin, and how the translation feature works.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:50Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/06/enable-multilingual-wordpress-content-with-the-updated-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress/","postDateTime":"2018-06-04T21:29:02Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Enable Multilingual WordPress Content with the Updated Amazon Polly Plugin for WordPress","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e  The Amazon Polly Plugin for WordPress can now automatically translate text to different languages, and convert the written content into multilingual audio formats. This new feature is powered by Amazon Translate, a neural machine translation service.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-05-new-developer-preview-use-amazon-polly-voices-in-alexa-skills","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/05/new-developer-preview-use-amazon-polly-voices-in-alexa-skills/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:54:31+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Starting today, you can apply to participate in a developer preview that allows you to use eight English (U.S.) Amazon Polly voices to narrate your Alexa skills.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf your skill uses only a single voice today, changing the voice or adding different voices in the right places may allow you to provide an even more engaging experience. Developers in the preview can select a different voice for any utterance by constructing output speech using the Structured Speech Markup Language (SSML) tags that are available through Alexa skills, and specifying an Amazon Polly voice using the “voice name” tag.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://alexa.au1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_bruwDnML6hZCKmp\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eApply today\u003c/a\u003e to join the preview and use Amazon Polly to voice your Alexa skills.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:35Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/05/new-developer-preview-use-amazon-polly-voices-in-alexa-skills/","postDateTime":"2018-05-16T11:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"New Developer Preview: Use Amazon Polly Voices in Alexa Skills","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Starting today, you can apply to participate in a developer preview that allows you to use eight English (U.S.) Amazon Polly voices to narrate your Alexa skills.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-04-amazon-polly-achieves-hipaa-eligibility","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/04/amazon-polly-achieves-hipaa-eligibility/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:37:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:54:59+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. The Text-to-Speech API is now an AWS HIPAA Eligible Service\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you have a Business Associate Addendum (BAA) in place with AWS, you can immediately start using Amazon Polly to generate speech from text containing protected health information (PHI). If you do not have a BAA in place with AWS, or have any other questions about running HIPAA-regulated workloads on AWS, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/health/providers-and-insurers/hipaa/inbound/\"\u003eplease contact us\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHIPAA Eligibility applies to all AWS Regions where Amazon Polly is available. See the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d0.awsstatic.com/whitepapers/compliance/AWS_HIPAA_Compliance_Whitepaper.pdf\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eArchitecting for HIPAA Security and Compliance on Amazon Web Services Whitepaper\u003c/a\u003e for information and best practices about how to configure AWS HIPAA Eligible Services to store, process, and transmit PHI. To learn more about Amazon Polly, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003ewebsite\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:03Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/04/amazon-polly-achieves-hipaa-eligibility/","postDateTime":"2018-04-24T20:21:20Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Achieves HIPAA Eligibility","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. The Text-to-Speech API is now an AWS HIPAA Eligible Service\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-03-amazon-polly-increases-character-limits","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-polly-increases-character-limits/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:37:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:53:56+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e  Amazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. To more easily enable the voicing of longer text input, Amazon Polly has doubled its character limit for the SynthesizeSpeech API operation. The maximum length of input text can be up to 3000 billed characters, or 6000 total characters including non-billed SSML tags.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eproduct page\u003c/a\u003e for more information about Amazon Polly, or log in to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to get started.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:27Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-polly-increases-character-limits/","postDateTime":"2018-04-09T00:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Increases Character Limits","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e  Amazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech, allowing you to create applications that talk, and build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. To more easily enable the voicing of longer text input, Amazon Polly has doubled its character limit for the SynthesizeSpeech API operation. The maximum length of input text can be up to 3000 billed characters, or 6000 total characters including non-billed SSML tags.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-03-amazon-polly-releases-new-ssml-breath-feature","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-polly-releases-new-ssml-breath-feature/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:25:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:21:39+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e  \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a Text-to-Speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. The new SSML Breath feature mimics the sound of inhalation and/or exhalation during normal speech. With the SSML Breath tag, you can now insert appropriate breath sounds to make the Amazon Polly generated speech sound even more natural, as if the text is being narrated by a human speaker. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use the \u0026lt;amazon:breath\u0026gt; and \u0026lt;amazon:auto-breaths\u0026gt; tags, or a combination of both, to incorporate breath sounds into your speech output.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eAutomated mode\u003c/b\u003e: Amazon Polly inserts breathing sounds automatically into the speech output, to simulate normal breathing without input from you. (You can also set the frequency of these intervals, as well as their volume and duration.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eManual mode\u003c/b\u003e: you set the location, duration, and volume of a breath sound for the text.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eMixed mode\u003c/b\u003e: a combination of customized breathing sounds that you insert, and that are inserted automatically by Amazon Polly.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy incorporating breath sounds into speech output from text, Amazon Polly is able to provide more naturally sounding speech, particularly for long-form narration of text.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLog in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and try the SSML Breath feature, or visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information about SSML tags.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:22Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-polly-releases-new-ssml-breath-feature/","postDateTime":"2018-03-22T00:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly releases new SSML Breath feature","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e  \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e is a Text-to-Speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. The new SSML Breath feature mimics the sound of inhalation and/or exhalation during normal speech. With the SSML Breath tag, you can now insert appropriate breath sounds to make the Amazon Polly generated speech sound even more natural, as if the text is being narrated by a human speaker. \u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-03-amazon-ec2-t2-instance-types-are-now-supported-on-windows-with-sql-server-enterprise","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-ec2-t2-instance-types-are-now-supported-on-windows-with-sql-server-enterprise/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:37:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:52:13+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eWindows with SQL Server Enterprise Edition is now available on t2.xlarge and t2.2xlarge instance types. Amazon EC2 T2 instances are the lowest-cost Amazon EC2 General Purpose instance type that provides a baseline level of CPU performance with the ability to burst above the baseline. T2 instances are ideal for a variety of general-purpose applications like micro-services, small and medium databases and product prototypes. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomers can now launch and run SQL Server Enterprise on t2.xlarge and t2.2xlarge instance types and enjoy fully supported Microsoft software licenses bundled with Amazon EC2. Buying from AWS with Microsoft licensing included has many benefits:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePay as you go with no upfront costs or long-term investments\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAWS managed Windows image\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAWS managed licensing compliance\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupport for \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/windows/resources/amis/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003elegacy versions\u003c/a\u003e of Microsoft software\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003et2.xlarge and t2.2xlarge instance types on Windows with SQL Server Enterprise are offered as On-Demand and Reserved Instance in the AWS US (Northern Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), US West (Northern California), Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Central), EU (Ireland), EU (London), EU ( Frankfurt), EU (Paris), South America (São Paulo), China (Beijing), China (Ningxia) and AWS GovCloud (US) Regions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo see the updated pricing, please visit \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/ec2/pricing/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon EC2 pricing page\u003c/a\u003e. For more information about T2 instances, please visit \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/ec2/instance-types/t2/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:56:12Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/03/amazon-ec2-t2-instance-types-are-now-supported-on-windows-with-sql-server-enterprise/","postDateTime":"2018-03-01T18:39:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon EC2 T2 instance types are now supported on Windows with SQL Server Enterprise ","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eWindows with SQL Server Enterprise Edition is now available on t2.xlarge and t2.2xlarge instance types. Amazon EC2 T2 instances are the lowest-cost Amazon EC2 General Purpose instance type that provides a baseline level of CPU performance with the ability to burst above the baseline. T2 instances are ideal for a variety of general-purpose applications like micro-services, small and medium databases and product prototypes. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-02-amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-govcloud-us-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-govcloud--us--region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:21:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:53:18+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003ePowered by advanced deep learning technologies, Amazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. The Text-to-Speech service is now available in the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.aws.amazon.com/govcloud-us\"\u003eAWS GovCloud (US) region\u003c/a\u003e, Amazon’s isolated cloud region built for sensitive data and regulated workloads.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this new region, Amazon Polly is now operating at sixteen AWS regions worldwide. You can learn more about our growing footprint at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\"\u003eGlobal Infrastructure page\u003c/a\u003e. In the meantime, we encourage our government customers and their partners to take advantage of the new AWS GovCloud (US) region for Amazon Polly. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  For more information about the service, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly product page\u003c/a\u003e, or simply log in to \u003ca href\u003d\"http://console.aws.amazon.com/polly\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e and try the service. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:55:53Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/amazon-polly-is-now-available-in-aws-govcloud--us--region/","postDateTime":"2018-02-28T18:39:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly is Now Available in AWS GovCloud (US) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003ePowered by advanced deep learning technologies, Amazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. The Text-to-Speech service is now available in the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.aws.amazon.com/govcloud-us\"\u003eAWS GovCloud (US) region\u003c/a\u003e, Amazon’s isolated cloud region built for sensitive data and regulated workloads.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-govcloud-us","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-govcloud-us","description":"general:products/aws-govcloud-us","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T18:41:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-02-amazon-polly-new-phonation-tag-enables-you-to-create-softer-speech","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/amazon-polly-new-phonation-tag-enables-you-to-create-softer-speech/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:29:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:23:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce a new phonation tag that you can use with Amazon Polly, an API-based Text-to-Speech (TTS) service. With the new phonation Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) tag, you can produce softer speech with any of the Amazon Polly voices.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the new phonation tag, Amazon Polly also supports other SSML features, such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#prosody-tag\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eprosody\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/new-amazon-polly-speech-marks/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ewhispered voice\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2017/09/amazon-polly-adds-dynamic-range-compression-drc-tag/\"\u003edynamic range compression\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/modify-the-timbre-of-amazon-polly-voices-with-the-new-vocal-tract-ssml-feature/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003evocal tract length\u003c/a\u003e – which allow you to further customize the voices to best suit your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#phonation-tag\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e on SSML tags for more information, and try the new feature through the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e!\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:55:46Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/amazon-polly-new-phonation-tag-enables-you-to-create-softer-speech/","postDateTime":"2018-02-15T14:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly New Phonation Tag Enables You to Create Softer Speech","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eToday, we are excited to announce a new phonation tag that you can use with Amazon Polly, an API-based Text-to-Speech (TTS) service. With the new phonation Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) tag, you can produce softer speech with any of the Amazon Polly voices.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-machine-learning","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-machine-learning","description":"general:products/amazon-machine-learning","dateCreated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-08T17:58:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2018-02-voice-your-web-content-with-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/voice-your-web-content-with-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:30:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:52:12+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Polly plugin for WordPress enables you to easily voice your website content – so readers can listen to news and articles directly from the site. Jointly developed with our partner, WP Engine, this sample plugin also enables you to publish podcasts directly from your site and make them available for listeners who are on-the-go.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that allows you to convert text to lifelike speech, using the same technology that powers Amazon Alexa. Choose from a selection of natural sounding voices across many languages. By adding voice to your website, you can provide your readers with an alternative way to consume your content and meet the needs of a larger audience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRead our latest \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/amazon-polly-gives-wordpress-a-voice/\"\u003eblog post\u003c/a\u003e to learn more about the Amazon Polly plugin. Or simply get started with the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/getting-started/tutorials/add-voice-to-wordpress-polly\"\u003e10-minute tutorial\u003c/a\u003e and begin voicing your WordPress content today!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:55:42Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2018/02/voice-your-web-content-with-amazon-polly-plugin-for-wordpress/","postDateTime":"2018-02-08T10:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Voice Your Web Content with Amazon Polly Plugin for WordPress","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Polly plugin for WordPress enables you to easily voice your website content – so readers can listen to news and articles directly from the site. Jointly developed with our partner, WP Engine, this sample plugin also enables you to publish podcasts directly from your site and make them available for listeners who are on-the-go.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2018","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2018","description":"year#2018","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:20:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-11-now-available-in-14-aws-regions-amazon-polly-adds-new-korean-language-support-and-an-indian-english-voice","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/11/now-available-in-14-aws-regions---amazon-polly-adds-new-korean-language-support-and-an-indian-english-voice/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:35:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:51:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eTo better serve a global audience, Amazon Polly announces the expansion to nine additional AWS Regions, as well as the release of Korean language support, and a new Indian English voice to our Text-to-Speech portfolio. Listen to the voice introductions from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/seoyeon_intro.wav\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSeoyeon\u003c/a\u003e, a new Korean female voice, and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/aditi_intro.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAditi\u003c/a\u003e, a new Indian English female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Amazon Polly portfolio now includes 52 voices across 25 languages, and is now available in 14 AWS Regions: Asia Pacific (Mumbai), Asia Pacific (Seoul), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Canada (Central), EU (Frankfurt), EU (Ireland), EU (London), South America (São Paulo), US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (N. California), US West (Oregon).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry them all out on our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\"\u003eAmazon Polly Console\u003c/a\u003e. Or, you can start your own voiced application with the help of our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/documentation/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:54:18Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/11/now-available-in-14-aws-regions---amazon-polly-adds-new-korean-language-support-and-an-indian-english-voice/","postDateTime":"2017-11-15T14:18:12Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Now available in 14 AWS Regions - Amazon Polly Adds New Korean Language Support and an Indian English Voice","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eTo better serve a global audience, Amazon Polly announces the expansion to nine additional AWS Regions, as well as the release of Korean language support, and a new Indian English voice to our Text-to-Speech portfolio. Listen to the voice introductions from \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/dam/product-marketing/Polly/voices/seoyeon_intro.wav\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSeoyeon\u003c/a\u003e, a new Korean female voice, and \u003ca href\u003d\"/content/dam/product-marketing/Polly/voices/aditi_intro.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAditi\u003c/a\u003e, a new Indian English female voice.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-11-amazon-polly-releases-new-timbre-effect","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/11/amazon-polly-releases-new-timbre-effect/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:35:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:57:30+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eControl the tonal quality of Amazon Polly’s voice output with the new vocal-tract-length Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) tag. Adjusting the “vocal tract length” will modify the tone quality, called timbre, to make a voice sound characteristically different without adjusting rate and pitch. This tag can be used with any of the voices in the Amazon Polly Text-to-Speech portfolio to produce many variations for a single voice.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Polly/Timbre_Sample1.wav\"\u003e\u0026lt;Listen to sample\u0026gt;\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou now have more options to customize the Amazon Polly voices – editing and adjusting timbre, rate and pitch to create new personas to fit your needs. Try the new timbre modification control effect through the Amazon Polly console, or visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#vocaltractlength-tag\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information around SSML tags.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:54:15Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/11/amazon-polly-releases-new-timbre-effect/","postDateTime":"2017-11-09T10:20:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Releases New Timbre Effect","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eControl the tonal quality of Amazon Polly’s voice output with the new vocal-tract-length Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) tag. Adjusting the “vocal tract length” will modify the tone quality, called timbre, to make a voice sound characteristically different without adjusting rate and pitch. This tag can be used with any of the voices in the Amazon Polly Text-to-Speech portfolio to produce many variations for a single voice.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-10-amazon-polly-releases-two-new-voices-and-is-now-available-in-asia-pacific-tokyo-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/10/amazon-polly-releases-two-new-voices-and-is-now-available-in-asia-pacific-tokyo-region/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:19:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:49:50+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d3ulk6ur3a3ha.cloudfront.net/product-marketing/Polly/voices/matthew.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMatthew\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d3ulk6ur3a3ha.cloudfront.net/product-marketing/Polly/voices/takumi.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eTakumi\u003c/a\u003e – the latest additions to the Amazon Polly text-to-speech portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMatthew is a confident and natural-sounding voice that rounds out our existing U.S. English selection, which also includes Ivy, Joanna, Joey, Justin, Kendra, Kimberly and Salli. Takumi is a pleasant and youthful male voice that complements Mizuki, the Japanese female voice. With these new releases, Amazon Polly offers a variety of options – 50 male and female voices across 24 languages – to provide you with greater choice and flexibility for your speech applications. Navigate to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAvailable Voices\u003c/a\u003e page for the full list of Amazon Polly voices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, Amazon Polly is now available in the Asia Pacific (Tokyo) region, increasing the number of supported AWS Regions to five. This expansion into a new AWS Region allows you to provision Amazon Polly closer to your users, providing an even more responsive experience. To learn more, visit \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eaws.amazon.com/polly\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:55:21Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/10/amazon-polly-releases-two-new-voices-and-is-now-available-in-asia-pacific-tokyo-region/","postDateTime":"2017-10-12T15:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Releases Two New Voices and is Now Available in Asia Pacific (Tokyo) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d3ulk6ur3a3ha.cloudfront.net/product-marketing/Polly/voices/matthew.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMatthew\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d3ulk6ur3a3ha.cloudfront.net/product-marketing/Polly/voices/takumi.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eTakumi\u003c/a\u003e – the latest additions to the Amazon Polly text-to-speech portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:marchitecture/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T19:26:14+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-industry#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-industry","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:industry/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-09-amazon-polly-adds-dynamic-range-compression-drc-tag","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/09/amazon-polly-adds-dynamic-range-compression-drc-tag/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:33:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:55:56+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now use the new dynamic range compression (DRC) tag to enhance the volume of certain sounds in your audio file. The sounds in an audio file range from softer sounds to louder, depending on the text, the language, and the voice. For example, conflicting ambient sounds such as those of a moving vehicle can often mask the softer sounds, making the audio track difficult to hear clearly. To enhance the clarity of the Text-to-Speech output, simply use the SSML tag “DRC” to mark the text input. This is especially suitable for audio to be used in noisy environments. DRC is a boolean parameter (meaning that it\u0027s either on or off) that can be used with any Amazon Polly supported voice or language. It can be used for an entire section of text, or only for a few words, based on your needs.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation on SSML tags\u003c/a\u003e for more information on the DRC tag, and try the new feature through the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e, today!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:53:45Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/09/amazon-polly-adds-dynamic-range-compression-drc-tag/","postDateTime":"2017-09-07T16:36:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Adds Dynamic Range Compression (DRC) Tag","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now use the new dynamic range compression (DRC) tag to enhance the volume of certain sounds in your audio file. The sounds in an audio file range from softer sounds to louder, depending on the text, the language, and the voice. For example, conflicting ambient sounds such as those of a moving vehicle can often mask the softer sounds, making the audio track difficult to hear clearly. To enhance the clarity of the Text-to-Speech output, simply use the SSML tag “DRC” to mark the text input. This is especially suitable for audio to be used in noisy environments. DRC is a boolean parameter (meaning that it\u0027s either on or off) that can be used with any Amazon Polly supported voice or language. It can be used for an entire section of text, or only for a few words, based on your needs.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-05-amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-german-female-voice-vicki","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/05/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-german-female-voice-vicki/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:27:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:57:26+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eYou now have the choice of a second female German voice, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d0.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/vicki.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eVicki\u003c/a\u003e, in addition to the German male voice Hans, and female voice Marlene. Vicki is a high-quality, TTS voice of a similar fluency and naturalness as the German voice of Alexa, able to fluently and intelligibly pronounce Anglicisms frequently used in German texts, including fully inflected version.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the addition of this new female German voice, there are now a total of 48 voices in Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech portfolio. All 48 Amazon Polly voices are accessible worldwide from the following AWS regions: US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), and EU (Ireland).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information about the service, navigate to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/voicelist.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAvailable Voices\u003c/a\u003e page for the full list of voices in the Amazon Polly portfolio, or go straight to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home/SynthesizeSpeech\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAmazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e to listen to all the Amazon Polly voices, today!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:52:40Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/05/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-german-female-voice-vicki/","postDateTime":"2017-05-18T16:06:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly introduces a new German female voice, Vicki","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eYou now have the choice of a second female German voice, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://d0.awsstatic.com/product-marketing/Polly/voices/vicki.mp3\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eVicki\u003c/a\u003e, in addition to the German male voice Hans, and female voice Marlene. Vicki is a high-quality, TTS voice of a similar fluency and naturalness as the German voice of Alexa, able to fluently and intelligibly pronounce Anglicisms frequently used in German texts, including fully inflected version.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the addition of this new female German voice, there are now a total of 48 voices in Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech portfolio. All 48 Amazon Polly voices are accessible worldwide from the following AWS regions: US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), and EU (Ireland).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-industry#artificial-intelligence","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-industry","name":"artificial-intelligence","description":"marketing:industry/artificial-intelligence","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:53:23+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2017-04-amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-whispered-voice-tag-and-speech-marks-for-synchronization-with-visual-animation","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/04/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-whispered-voice-tag-and-speech-marks-for-synchronization-with-visual-animation/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:25:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:37:12+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now add a whispered speech effect in your Text-to-Speech output with Amazon Polly, and synchronize speech with visual animation using Speech Marks. To create voices with a whispered effect, you simply use the SSML tag “whispered” to mark the text input to be spoken in a hushed or whispered voice. This tag can be applied to any of the 47 voices in Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech portfolio. Visit \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#whispered-tag\"\u003ethe Amazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information on how to use the new “whispered” SSML tag.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, the new Speech Marks feature in Amazon Polly allows you to build visual animations that are synchronized with speech output. With Speech Marks, you can request a stream of metadata with information about the offset of specific elements of text in the generated speech, including sentences, words, SSML tags, and visemes (which describe facial cues that correspond to the sounds that are spoken). Using this metadata stream, in combination with the synthesized speech audio stream, you can now build applications with an enhanced visual experience, such as avatars with speech-synchronized facial animations, or karaoke-style word highlighting. Speech Marks metadata requires a separate API request and incurs the same per-character pricing as for speech output, at a rate of $4.00 per 1 million characters, when outside of the free tier. Visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/pricing/\"\u003eAmazon Polly pricing page\u003c/a\u003e for details. You can still take advantage of the free tier which includes 5 million characters per month, for the first 12 months, starting from the first request for speech. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the Amazon Polly \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/speechmarks.html\"\u003edocumentation on Speech Marks\u003c/a\u003e for more information, and try both new features through \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/polly/home\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ethe Amazon Polly console\u003c/a\u003e, today!\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:52:28Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2017/04/amazon-polly-introduces-a-new-whispered-voice-tag-and-speech-marks-for-synchronization-with-visual-animation/","postDateTime":"2017-04-19T17:25:55Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Amazon Polly Introduces a new Whispered Voice Tag, and Speech Marks for Synchronization with Visual Animation","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eYou can now add a whispered speech effect in your Text-to-Speech output with Amazon Polly, and synchronize speech with visual animation using Speech Marks. To create voices with a whispered effect, you simply use the SSML tag “whispered” to mark the text input to be spoken in a hushed or whispered voice. This tag can be applied to any of the 47 voices in Amazon Polly’s Text-to-Speech portfolio. Visit \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/supported-ssml.html#whispered-tag\"\u003ethe Amazon Polly documentation\u003c/a\u003e for more information on how to use the new “whispered” SSML tag.\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2017","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2017","description":"year#2017","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:16:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2016-11-introducing-amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2016/11/introducing-amazon-polly/","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:28:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T13:50:37+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Polly lets you create applications that talk, enabling you to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Polly is an Amazon AI service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. Polly includes 47 lifelike voices spread across 24 languages, so you can select the ideal voice and build speech-enabled applications that work in many different countries. With Polly, you only pay for the number of characters you convert to speech, and you can save and replay Polly’s generated speech. Polly’s low cost per character converted, and lack of restrictions on storage and reuse of voice output, make it a cost-effective way to enable Text-to-Speech everywhere.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo get started with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/\"\u003eAmazon Polly\u003c/a\u003e, simply log in to the Polly console to try the service with your own text. Learn more about Polly and ideal use cases by reading \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/polly-text-to-speech-in-47-voices-and-24-languages/\"\u003eour blog\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/polly/latest/dg/what-is.html\"\u003eDocumentation\u003c/a\u003e. The client SDK is available \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/polly/developers/#sdk\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n","modifiedDate":"2019-10-06T04:51:24Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2016/11/introducing-amazon-polly/","postDateTime":"2016-11-30T17:11:01Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"Introducing Amazon Polly","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003eAmazon Polly is a service that turns text into lifelike speech. Polly lets you create applications that talk, enabling you to build entirely new categories of speech-enabled products. Polly is an Amazon AI service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. Polly includes 47 lifelike voices spread across 24 languages, so you can select the ideal voice and build speech-enabled applications that work in many different countries. With Polly, you only pay for the number of characters you convert to speech, and you can save and replay Polly’s generated speech. Polly’s low cost per character converted, and lack of restrictions on storage and reuse of voice output, make it a cost-effective way to enable Text-to-Speech everywhere.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#amazon-polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"amazon-polly","description":"general:products/amazon-polly","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#launch-announcement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Launch Announcement","description":"Launch Announcement","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:08+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2016","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2016","description":"year#2016","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T14:14:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T14:14:35+0000"}]}],"metadata":{"count":80,"totalHits":80},"fieldTypes":{"regionalAvailability":"LongText","nofollow":"Boolean","date":"Date","language":"Text","title":"Text","postDateTime":"DateTime","body":"Text","postSummary":"LongText","ctaLabel":"Text","mediaThumbnail":"Text","nosnippet":"Boolean","price":"Text","ctaLink":"URL","headline":"Text","contentType":"Text","bodyBack":"LongText","secondaryCTALabel":"Text","primaryCTALink":"URL","noindex":"Boolean","level":"Text","heading":"Text","mediaType":"Text","mediaAlt":"Text","headlineUrl":"Text","mediaSrc":"URL","durationMinutes":"Number","badge":"JSON","videoImageUrl":"URL","postBody":"LongText","secondaryCTALink":"URL","Video":"URL","modifiedDate":"DateTime","namePerson":"Text","location":"Text","time":"Text","publishedDate":"DateTime","durationReadtime":"Number","primaryCTALabel":"Text"}}